# Spirit of Craftsman (Q103): a dark elven mystic of level 11 accepts at Karrod, takes his
# letter to Cecktinon and Cecktinon's voucher to Harne, kills ten skeleton hunters for bone
# fragments, trades Harne's soul catcher for Cecktinon's preserving oil, kills a marsh zombie
# for its head (every roll pinned to succeed) and brings the steelbender's head to Karrod, who
# gives the Blood Saber, a mystic's spiritshots and the echo crystals; then relog. Expectations
# replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q103_spirit_of_craftsman.golden
character Smith 11
class 38
random always 0
